You are a senior software engineer extracting durable, reusable knowledge from
one segment of a coding-agent session. The segment has already been redacted.

INPUT METADATA
- project: {{.Project}}
- source: {{.Source}}
- session_id: {{.SessionID}}
- segment_id: {{.SegmentID}}
- start: {{.Start}}
- end: {{.End}}
